---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="relative z-10 mt-24 border-t border-rule">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 py-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-native">⚘</span>
          <span class="font-serif text-lg text-ink">rootfast</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-2 max-w-md">
          A free, public-domain plant API and the website that browses it.
          Built from USDA PLANTS data with taxonomic identity provided by the
          <a class="link-hover text-ink" href="https://www.gbif.org/dataset/d7dddbf4-2cf0-4f39-9b2a-bb099caae36c" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GBIF Backbone</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <p class="label mb-3">Browse</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a class="link-hover" href="/search">Search plants</a></li>
          <li><a class="link-hover" href="/states">All states</a></li>
          <li><a class="link-hover" href="/docs">API documentation</a></li>
          <li><a class="link-hover" href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
          <li><a class="link-hover" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <p class="label">Sources &amp; attribution</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm text-ink-2">
          <li>USDA PLANTS Database — public domain</li>
          <li>USDA-ARS Plant Hardiness Zone Map (2023) — public domain</li>
          <li>GBIF Backbone Taxonomy — <a class="link-hover text-ink" href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">CC0</a></li>
          <li>iNaturalist — per-photo CC license preserved</li>
          <li>Hosted on Cloudflare Workers + D1 + Pages</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-10">
      <hr class="rule" />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-ink-3">
      <p class="font-mono">© {year} · rootfast.org · MIT licensed code · CC0 data</p>
      <p class="font-mono">
        <a class="link-hover text-ink" href="https://github.com/cjscrofani/rootfast" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/cjscrofani/rootfast ↗</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
